                            Global statistics highlight a universal need for accessible care.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS A SAFE SPACE -->
        <section id="what-is" class="py-16 bg-[#f9fbfd] border-t border-slate-100">
            <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <!-- Section Title & Core Definition Card -->
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#12519C] mb-6">What is a Safe Space?</h2>
                    
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#27A0DB]/20 shadow-md relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-24 h-24 bg-[#F6C401]/20 rounded-full blur-xl"></div>
                        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#12519C] leading-relaxed">
                            "A place where you feel safe enough to speak about your personal problems and get help."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Sub-heading & 3 Key Signs Cards -->
                <div class="mt-12">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#12519C] text-center mb-8">Three Key Signs of a Safe Space</h3>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                        <!-- Sign 1 -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#12519C]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#12519C] mb-6">
                                <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 10h4.764a2 2 0 011.789 2.894l-3.5 7A2 2 0 0115.263 21h-4.017c-.163 0-.326-.02-.485-.06L7 20m7-10V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-.095c-.5 0-.905.405-.905.905 0 .714-.211 1.412-.608 2.006L7 11v9m7-10h-2M7 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2h2.5"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#12519C] mb-3">1. Respect & Non-Judgment</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                                Active listening and mutual respect without bias, criticism, or stigma. You can express your true feelings without fear.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Sign 2 -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#27A0DB]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#27A0DB] mb-6">
                                <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#12519C] mb-3">2. Confidentiality & Trust</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                                Private, secure conversations where personal information and disclosures are protected with complete discretion.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Sign 3 -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#F6C401]/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#12519C] mb-6">
                                <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
